      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dominant ferromagnetic Mn–Mn exchange (La diamagnetic). χMT rises from 23.65 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K to 41.68 cm3 K mol−1 at 3 K then 40.09 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization fit gives S = 8, g* = 2.05, D = −0.1693 cm−1; M = 15.71 NμB at 2 K and 8 T. Out-of-phase χ″M peak appears under 500 Oe dc field; Arrhenius fit Ueff = 6.88 K, τ0 = 1.48 × 10−5 s, indicating slow relaxation of the Mn core.",
